          "basis": "calibrated numerical bracket: sustains ~208 GB/s per stack, numerically bracketing the ~202 GB/s of arXiv 2608.11668 whose physical conditions (write-heavy KV, 80 C safe junction, ~54 W 3D-ICE projection) differ from this pure-read 6 pJ/bit parameterization"
        },
        {
          "boundary_c": 65,
          "neighbor_heat_c": 20,
          "overlay": "../overlays/hbf/thermal-boundary-65c.cfg",
          "basis": "NVL72-class maximum liquid return mapped to the RC boundary as a model assumption (coolant-loop envelope, not an HBF measurement)"
        },
        {
          "boundary_c": 70,
          "neighbor_heat_c": 25,
          "overlay": "../overlays/hbf/thermal-boundary-70c.cfg",
          "basis": "full-load GPU package neighborhood assumption; >=75 C fails closed by policy (the governor could never release) as a guard against silently permanent throttling, not as a physical operating limit: 75-80 C boundaries retain a positive pacing budget but would be permanently throttled"
        }
      ]
    }
